    "identifier": "push-shot",
    "description": "<p>You perform a flurry of attacks, that forces their targets back. Make two ranged taijutsu attacks. On a hit, you deal your [Weapons damage] + 1d8. A creature you hit must make a Constitution saving throw, being pushed back 10-feet on a hit.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: A creature who fails their saving throw also suffers a 10-foot movement speed penalty, until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8.</p>",
